question: Show the stadium name and capacity with most number of concerts in year 2014 or after., query SPARQL:

result:
```sparql
SELECT ?stadium_name ?capacity (COUNT(?concert) AS ?concert_count)
WHERE {
  ?concert :concert\#year "2014" ;
           :concert\#ref-stadium_id ?stadium .
  ?stadium :stadium\#name ?stadium_name ;
             :stadium\#capacity ?capacity .
}
GROUP BY ?stadium_name ?capacity
ORDER BY DESC(?concert_count)
LIMIT 1
```

